{
  "_notes": [
    "Embedded registry of pre-built MNN runtime bundles. Mirrors the shape",
    "used by CircleAI.Core\\Models\\embedded_registry.json (non-object",
    "entries like this _notes array are tolerated by the parser).",
    "",
    "Real release URLs + SHA-256s pulled from",
    "https://github.com/alibaba/MNN/releases/tag/3.5.0 (2026-04-07).",
    "Last refreshed: 2026-06-05. Bytes hashed locally with sha256sum.",
    "",
    "Reality vs prior speculative registry:",
    "  - Alibaba ships ONE bundle per (OS, arch) carrying MULTIPLE backends,",
    "    not one bundle per (OS, arch, backend). The Windows x64 ZIP contains",
    "    both the CPU and OpenCL libraries; the macOS universal bundle covers",
    "    CPU + OpenCL + Metal; the iOS bundle ships CPU + Metal + CoreML; the",
    "    Android universal bundle ships CPU + OpenCL + Vulkan.",
    "  - To preserve the existing (os, arch, backend) -> bundle lookup API,",
    "    we register each (os, arch, backend) tuple pointing at the same",
    "    underlying zip + sha. The fetcher will extract the same archive",
    "    multiple times (once per backend tuple); we accept this storage",
    "    overhead as the simpler 1.2.0 trade-off vs reshaping the API.",
    "  - Backends NOT shipped pre-built by Alibaba (need source build):",
    "    Linux arm64, Linux loong64, Windows arm64, CUDA (any OS), Ascend,",
    "    Cambricon, HarmonyOS. These were in the prior speculative registry",
    "    and are now correctly absent.",
    "",
    "Fallback URL convention: same github.com/alibaba/MNN/releases/download",
    "path as primary. Primary uses HTTPS direct; fallback also uses HTTPS",
    "direct — same host. The real fallback story is to mirror these onto",
    "modelscope.cn (Alibaba's sovereign mirror) once that pipeline is wired;",
    "until then both URIs point at the canonical GitHub release.",
    "",
    "Refresh procedure (for new MNN releases):",
    "  1. gh release list --repo alibaba/MNN",
    "  2. gh release view <version> --repo alibaba/MNN --json assets",
    "  3. curl -sL -o $asset 'https://github.com/alibaba/MNN/releases/download/<version>/$asset'",
    "  4. sha256sum $asset",
    "  5. Update version + url + sha256 in this file"
  ],

